  <item>
    <title>行到水云处，桨声灯影梦金陵。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6729b003d63dca32557d23d1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6729b003d63dca32557d23d1</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Nov 2024 05:51:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>南京的调和地气，养文人，没有北方的帮派意识，没有商业氛围，恰好在一个亚中心的地带，枯荣自守，自开自落，再远就闭塞，再近又焦灼了。——黎戈</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一集我们分享了独属于我们的的南京回忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span>学校里，寡淡的鸭血粉丝让我们在回忆时笑声连连。</span></p><span></span><p><span>学校旁的锅贴店的好味道让我们想起冬天厚厚的衣服外再套着校服，三个人放学后吃着热锅贴的夜晚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>夫子庙的汤包，秦淮河的甜品让我们想起《儒林外史》的菜佣酒保，《家住六朝烟水间》的六朝烟水气 。</span></p><span></span><p><span>南大后面买手摇咖啡的老奶奶和小戴猫灌饼让我们在异国发现同乡人，让陌生人变成有过同一段经历的朋友。</span></p><span></span><p><span>南京博物院，民国馆，江宁织造府的文化底蕴值得一看再看。</span></p><span></span><p><span>颐和路上的民国老建筑让我们想起曹文轩先生的独特美学，让我们想起那些小说里在最风雨飘摇的年代里仍然闪烁着的人性光辉。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="94">01:34</a> 锅贴</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">03:06</a> 鸭血粉丝&amp;回味</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="498">08:18</a> 汤包&amp;夫子庙甜品</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="683">11:23</a> 秦淮河&amp;儒林外史</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1070">17:50</a> 九华山&amp;中山陵&amp;科巷</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1277">21:17</a> 手摇咖啡的老奶奶</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1331">22:11</a> 小戴猫灌饼&amp;盐水鸭&amp;糖芋苗&amp;桂花糕</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">26:58</a> 南京博物院&amp;八佰&amp;江宁织造府</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1778">29:38</a> 太平北路校区&amp;1912</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1986">33:06</a> 鸡鸣寺</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2075">34:35</a> 牛首山&amp;金陵小镇&amp;茶颜悦色</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a> 喝丢一只鞋&amp;大脸鸡排&amp;学而思</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2386">39:46</a> 南京大排档</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2607">43:27</a> 蜻蜓眼&amp;颐和路&amp;曹文轩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3632">1:00:32</a> up主自己弹的</span><strong><span>秦淮景</span></strong></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu88nPzPfWI1sqFalYxI0D30M1vE.m4a" length="60295217" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:02:04</itunes:duration>
